VALUES (63777, 'tt3906560', NULL, 'Moonbeam City', 'Moonbeam City', 'tv', 2015, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnwhhJC5DmWspDxRAoCKD6rk4XK.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hk1dr0VgmeiGOxjevOMqK0jlIFn.jpg', 'An absurdist, retro-futuristic 80s cop extravaganza. The series follows undercover detective Dazzle Novak, a handsome idiot who commits more crimes than most criminals. His tyrannical chief, Pizzaz Miller, won''t get off his back, and hotshot rookie Rad Cunningham is dying to see him fail. With the world against him, Dazzle is thrust into a living nightmare: having to do actual police work.', NULL, NULL, 2.8024, 5.795, 0, 8.817499999999999e+00, '2026-07-29 20:51:09', '2026-10-16 22:59:46')
