VALUES (951, 'tt0099938', NULL, 'Kindergarten Cop', 'Kindergarten Cop', 'movie', 1990, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nKnHWwkXyvhzCYWm3FyRAv3qBrl.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qWP5TlH1448Pt9ayyuLZJY0NXWj.jpg', 'Hard-edged cop John Kimble gets more than he bargained for when he goes undercover as a kindergarten teacher to get the goods on a brutal drug lord while at the same time protecting the man''s young son. Pitted against a class of boisterous moppets whose antics try his patience and test his mettle, Kimble may have met his match … in more ways than one.', NULL, NULL, 3.207, 6.128, 0, 8.5240000000000009e+00, '2026-07-31 03:33:23', '2026-10-16 22:59:46')
