VALUES (25103, 'tt0050766', NULL, 'Night of the Demon', 'Night of the Demon', 'movie', 1957, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePAjGAhynpwEI5HbpIrB28ML6lg.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bUFWLSQsSYdyy4eohp4iBBnOV1s.jpg', 'American professor John Holden arrives in London for a conference on parapsychology only to discover that the colleague he was supposed to meet was killed in a freak accident the day before. It turns out that the deceased had been investigating a cult lead by Dr. Julian Karswell. Though a skeptic, Holden is suspicious of the devil-worshiping Karswell. Following a trail of mysterious manuscripts, Holden enters a world that makes him question his faith in science.', NULL, NULL, 2.5085, 7.031, 0, 11.015, '2026-08-10 02:34:01', '2026-10-16 22:59:46')
